WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.767
Adding three-digit numbers

2
00:00:04.967 --> 00:00:13.133
The farmer picked two hundred thirty-eight oranges on the first day and one hundred forty-five on the second day.

3
00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:17.300
Two hundred thirty-eight plus one hundred forty-five.

4
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:21.900
First add the ones: eight and five is thirteen.

5
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:26.233
We write the three and carry one ten to the tens.

6
00:00:26.233 --> 00:00:30.000
Tens: one, three and four make eight.

7
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.267
Hundreds: two and one make three.

8
00:00:33.267 --> 00:00:37.000
The answer is three hundred eighty-three.
